  title: 'The Testosterone-Sleep Connection: Why Poor Sleep Is Tanking Your T Levels',
  metaDesc: 'Most of your daily testosterone is produced during sleep. One week of poor sleep reduces testosterone by up to 15%. Here\'s the research — and what to do about it.',
  primaryKeyword: 'testosterone and sleep',
